I give up.

Amiga NH3.1.3, official binaries.

Yep, it can't find the mine level files, which are sitting prettily in
HackExe:.  I vaguely remember that the solution was to add the
HackExe: to the PATH: line in the NetHack.cnf file.

However, there's no description anywhere of the syntax for that
line.  These don't seem to work:

PATH=NetHack:,HackExe:
PATH=NetHack:;HackExe:
PATH=NetHack::HackExe:
PATH=NetHack:HackExe:

Someone want to enlighten me?  E-mail please.  I'd rather not find out
by downloading and examining the source....

It seems like it wouldn't be too hard to fix the distribution version
of the NetHack.cnf file to deal with this properly.

